# Fond Dark — libadwaita's dark palette, expressed as a Plasma colour scheme.
#
# The dark counterpart of FondLight.colors, taken from the same source: the
# @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) block of libadwaita's own stylesheet.
#
#   Colors:Window        @window_bg_color            #222226
#   Colors:View          @view_bg_color              #1d1d20
#   Colors:Button        @card_bg_color              #343437  (white 8% on window)
#   Colors:Header        @sidebar_bg_color           #2e2e32
#   Colors:Complementary @secondary_sidebar_bg_color #28282c
#   Colors:Tooltip       @popover_bg_color           #36363a
#   Selection            @accent_bg_color            #3584e4
#
# Note the stack inverts against the light scheme and stays correct: in dark,
# the *view* is the darkest plane and chrome is lighter, which is exactly how
# Adwaita orders them. Fond's four surfaces are a stacking order, not a set of
# fixed tones, so the theme reads the same either way round.

